#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.rst:113
msgid "Stencil operations are a set of operations that allow writing to an efficient buffer in an hardware-accelerated manner. This is generally used to mask in or out parts of the scene."
msgstr ""

